<title>JAPAN: Kyushu Elec to start reactor July 25 - sources.</title>
<headline>Kyushu Elec to start reactor July 25 - sources.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kyushu Electric Power Co Inc plans to start commercial operation of a 1.18 million kilowatt (kw) nuclear reactor in the southern Japan island of Kyushu on July 25, industry sources said on Tuesday.</p>
</text>
